{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂46navi 即売会」 でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、ビンゴ大会！\nまいちゅんと中田でガラガラひいたよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDを3名と色紙を10名の先着13名にプレゼントしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめぺろ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて、即売会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーナビ先着50名\n＋おまけに3名\nお名前とサイン書きをさせてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お得なイベントでしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋外でのイベントだったので\n日陰の方は寒かったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひかないように\nお風呂ゆっくり入って\n温まってくださいね～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の雰囲気だと\n今日、明日と2日連続\n会えるかたもたくさんいるのかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年中にやっておきたいことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玉ねぎのおぬぬめな食べ方は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな朝ごはんのメニューは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、握手会の後は\nらじらー！だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうキャッチフレーズは応募してくれました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日サンエトのキャッチフレーズが決まっちゃうんだね！\nどきどき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/1867542/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}